; ========================================================
; Portable Local AI - Models Preset Template
; ========================================================
; This file is an example of how presets are structured.
; Start-AI-Router.bat automatically auto-generates models.ini by scanning
; your Models folder, so you normally do NOT need to edit this file manually.
;
; If you wish to customize context size, thread count, or GPU offloading,
; you can define your custom presets here.
;
; Section name = Model alias shown in the Web UI dropdown
;
; Example Text / Reasoning Model:
; [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B]
; model = Models/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B-Q4_K_M.gguf
; ctx-size = 8192
; n-gpu-layers = 0
;
; Example Multimodal Vision Model (Requires model + mmproj):
; [Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct]
; model = Models/Qwen2.5-VL-7B/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf
; mmproj = Models/Qwen2.5-VL-7B/mmproj-Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-F16.gguf
; ctx-size = 8192
; n-gpu-layers = 0
